  "description": "<p>This area rug features a unique Bigfoot design, adding a touch of adventure and personality to any room. Crafted for durability and comfort, it brings a rustic charm to your home. This rug is an ideal choice for nature enthusiasts looking to enhance their living space.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Detailed Sasquatch design for a distinctive look.</li>\n<li>Non-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Soft surface provides a cozy feel underfoot.</li>\n<li>Designed for low maintenance and easy cleaning.</li>\n<li>Adds rustic charm to various room settings.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Living Room, Bedroom, Cabin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Bigfoot, Sasquatch, Outdoor Adventure, Nature, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This rug is well-suited for adding a unique touch to living rooms, bedrooms, or cabins. Its rustic theme makes it perfect for spaces that appreciate nature and wildlife aesthetics.</p>",
